age options][1]\r\n3. `quarkus.container-image.push` (and `registry`) is set, so no need to push into the local docker daemon.\r\n\r\nThis is why I think that it is a bug\r\n\r\n[1]: <https://quarkus.io/guides/container-image#quarkus-container-image-jib_quarkus.jib.native-entrypoint>","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/1225850796/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Diom","id":1903065,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MDMwNjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1903065?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Diom","html_url":"https://github.com/Diom","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Diom/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Diom/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Diom/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Diom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Diom/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Diom/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Diom/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Diom/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Diom/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":7251845295,"node_id":"MEE_lADOCFbutM5Qa4-VzwAAAAGwPmCv","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/events/7251845295","actor":{"login":"geoand","id":4374975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNzQ5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4374975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand","html_url":"https://github.com/geoand","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/geoand/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https: